SCRIPT:Intro1
"GANDALF: HALT!!! Dread has come upon you all! Alas it has come more swiftly than I guessed."
End

SCRIPT:Intro2
"GANDALF: The Goblins are upon you! Behold! The bats are above his army like a sea of locusts!\nThey ride upon wolves, and Wargs are in their trains!"
End

SCRIPT:Intro3
"GANDALF: Come! There is yet time for council. Let Dain son of Nain come swiftly to us!"
End

SCRIPT:Warning
"Should all the heroes fall, the battle is over."
End

SCRIPT:Elvenking
"Elves, to me! Strike them all down!!!"
End

SCRIPT:Bard
"Go forth Men of Dale! Charge and give them no quarter!"
End

SCRIPT:KingDainsArmy
"Come dwarves of the Iron Hills! We have been called into battle!!! Khazad Ai Menû!"
End

SCRIPT:EaglesCome
"Down with the goblins!"
End

