Map:battleoffivearmies/Desc
"With the supposed death of Smaug, the men of Laketown (Esgaroth), the dwarves of the Iron Hills and the Lonely Mountain, and the Elvenking's legions join together to fight the goblin army.\n(Map idea based on The Hobbit from eragon6178, everything else by Link058)"
End